% BPHY-2015-02 fig_01d: double parton scattering, two gg -> J/psi g sub-processes (hatched circle = colour-singlet J/psi)
layout: v2
in: g1 g2 h1 h2
out: g3 h3
g1 -- [gluon] a1
g2 -- [gluon] b1
c1 -- [gluon] g3
a1 -- [fermion] m1 [hatched blob] -- [fermion] c1 -- [fermion] b1 -- [fermion] a1
h1 -- [gluon] a2
h2 -- [gluon] b2
c2 -- [gluon] h3
a2 -- [fermion] m2 [hatched blob] -- [fermion] c2 -- [fermion] b2 -- [fermion] a2
